    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overcome bosses</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenge strong bosses to gain access to their loot</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/b8f8a507f896234bdb0254f2ecf94588.poster.avif?t=1738614686\" width=800 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/b8f8a507f896234bdb0254f2ecf94588.webm?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/b8f8a507f896234bdb0254f2ecf94588.mp4?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete quests</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obstacle runs, fix a clock tower, find flowers, chase a bunny, summon a ghost, and more</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/2d2498c5b0e3b799312701ede8727ba2.avif?t=1738614686\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find new spells and upgrade them</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dash, slam, shoot beams, bubble shield, throw placements, and more!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/a0262de4e6a62ce8f9eee401b07fee91.poster.avif?t=1738614686\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/a0262de4e6a62ce8f9eee401b07fee91.webm?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/a0262de4e6a62ce8f9eee401b07fee91.mp4?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive waves of monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use  arenas to train against monsters</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/9c878343bec005f3a147b87097dc6742.poster.avif?t=1738614686\" width=800 height=312 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/9c878343bec005f3a147b87097dc6742.webm?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/9c878343bec005f3a147b87097dc6742.mp4?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize the character with outfits and dyes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dye your skin, hair, eyes, and clothes to your liking</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/f76f743bbe9dc625a169b6cb289a7ffa.poster.avif?t=1738614686\" width=800 height=562 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/f76f743bbe9dc625a169b6cb289a7ffa.webm?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3234930/extras/f76f743bbe9dc625a169b6cb289a7ffa.mp4?t=1738614686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
